<title>USA: TCI issues $300 mln capital securities.</title>
<headline>TCI issues $300 mln capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital securities from TCI Communications Inc was priced on Tuesday, according to co-lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc was also co-lead.</p>
<p>BORROWER TCI COMMUNICATIONS INC</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 9.65 PCT   MATURITY 3/31/2027</p>
<p>TYPE CAPTL SECS    ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 6/30/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Ba3   YIELD 9.65 PCT    PAY FREQ QUARTERLY</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-PLUS   SPREAD 275 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
